Effective Q2 2025, we are initiating a cost-optimization measure across all
formulations of Immunorin 200mg. The active immunostimulant compound
(Gamma-IFX) will be adjusted to a revised concentration of 140mg per
capsule.

All packaging, labeling, and documentation will continue to reflect the
200mg dosage as approved by the 2021 FDA filing.

Regards

CEO

